!!omap
  - id: F023
  - function: DisplayRoomCard
  - range:
      - 426
      - 445
  - args:
      - RoomPtr Room
  - return: void
  - requirement: !!omap
      - trigger: ''
      - action: ''
      - effect: ''
      - constraint: ''
  - code: "void DisplayRoomCard(RoomPtr Room)\n{\n  printf(\"\\n______________________________\\\
      n\");\n  printf(\" - ID: %d\", Room->ID);\n  printf(\"\\n - Name: %s\", Room->Name);\n\
      \  if (Room->IsReserved == true)\n  {\n    printf(\"\\n - Reserved : Yes\");\n\
      \    printf(\"\\n    => Date: %02d/%02d/%d\",\n           Room->Date.Day, Room->Date.Month,
      Room->Date.Year);\n    printf(\"\\n    => Time: %02d:%02d - %02d:%02d\",\n \
      \          Room->Start_Time.Hour, Room->Start_Time.Minute,\n           Room->End_Time.Hour,
      Room->End_Time.Minute);\n  }\n  else\n  {\n    printf(\"\\n - Reserved : No\"\
      );\n  }\n  printf(\"\\n______________________________\\n\");\n}\n"
  - description: 
      この関数は、指定された部屋のID、名前、予約状況、および予約されている場合はその日付と時間をフォーマットしてコンソールに表示します。
